<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Welcome to the DOJU Waitlist</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: #f5f5f5;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      }

      .container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }

      .header {
        background: #a9f334;
        padding: 40px 20px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 40px 30px;
        color: #333333;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 24px;
      }

      .highlight {
        background: #f7f7f7;
        border-left: 4px solid #a9f334;
        padding: 16px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin: 24px 0;
        color: #444;
      }

      .footer {
        background: #f7f7f7;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #666666;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <!-- HEADER -->
      <div class="header">
        <h1>You have been invited as an admin on DOJU</h1>
      </div>

      <!-- BODY -->
      <div class="content">
        <p>Hi {{ fullName }},</p>

        <p>
          You have been invited to join DOJU as an admin.
        </p>

        <div class="highlight">
          <strong>What happens next?</strong>
          <div>We will email you as soon as DOJU is ready for early access.</div>
        </div>

        <p>
          If you want to share feedback or tell us what you would love to see,
          kindly reply to this email. We make sure to read every response.
        </p>

        <p>
          Best regards,<br />
          The DOJU Team
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- FOOTER -->
      <div class="footer">
        You are receiving this email because you joined the DOJU waitlist with {{ email }}.
        <br /><br />
        (c) 2026 DOJU
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
